MAYOR OF BANDAR LAMPUNG
LAMPUNG PROVINCE
REGIONAL REGULATION OF BANDAR LAMPUNG CITY
NUMBER: 03 YEAR 2019
CONCERNING
PROTECTION OF WOMEN
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
MAYOR OF BANDAR LAMPUNG,

Considering : a. that in the framework of fulfilling the constitutional rights of women, every citizen has the right to be free from torture or treatment that degrades human dignity, has the right to obtain a sense of security and freedom from all forms of violence and to improve the quality of life of women which is one of the responsibilities of the Regional Government;
b. that in the effort to fulfill women's rights, efforts need to be made by families, communities, and the Regional Government, as referred to in letter a, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women;

In View of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 28 Year 1959 concerning Stipulation of Emergency Law Number 4 Year 1956 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1956 Number 55, Emergency Law Number 5 Year 1956 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1956 Number 57) concerning Formation of Level II Regions Including Municipality Within the Level I Region of South Sumatra as Law (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1959 Number 73, Supplement to State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1821);
3. Law Number 7 Year 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of all forms of Discrimination Against Women (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1984 Number 29, Supplement to State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3277);
4. Law Number 19 Year 1999 concerning Ratification of ILO Convention Number 105 Concerning The Abolition Of Forced Labour (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 55, Supplement to State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3834);
5. Law Number 39 Year 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 165, Supplement to State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);
6. Law Number 13 Year 2003 concerning Manpower (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2003 Number 39, Supplement to State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia 4279);
7. Law Number 23 Year 2004 concerning Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 95, Supplement to State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);
8. Law Number 13 Year 2006 concerning Protection of Witnesses and Victims (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2006 Number 64, Supplement to State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4635);
9. Law Number 21 Year 2007 concerning Eradication of the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2009 Number 58, Supplement to State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4720);
10. Law Number 11 Year 2008 concerning Information and Electronic Transactions (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2008 Number 58, Supplement to State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4843);
